            "id": "https://roastduck-zz.github.io/2026/08/11/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C/",
            "url": "https://roastduck-zz.github.io/2026/08/11/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C/",
            "title": "技术手册：常用 CAN 命令与关节模组 ID 修改",
            "date_published": "2026-08-11T02:49:13.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>这篇文章用于集中记录工作中经常使用的命令和标准操作流程。内容按功能分节整理，后续遇到新的命令、参数或注意事项时，可直接在对应章节中补充。</p>\n<p><span id=\"more\"></span></p>\n<h2 id=\"使用说明\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#使用说明\">#</a> 使用说明</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>命令中的 <code>can1</code> 是当前使用的 CAN 接口；实际环境不同时需替换。</li>\n<li><code>&lt;OLD_CAN_ID&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;NEW_CAN_ID&gt;</code> 和 <code>&lt;NEW_ID_INT32_LE&gt;</code> 是占位符，执行前必须替换为实际值。</li>\n<li>涉及参数写入时，建议依次完成“查询、修改、复查、保存、再次确认”，避免只写入但未持久化。</li>\n<li>每次修改本文后，同步更新文末的维护记录和 front matter 中的 <code>updated</code> 时间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实时查看-can-信号日志\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#实时查看-can-信号日志\">#</a> 实时查看 CAN 信号日志</h2>\n<p>使用 <code>candump</code> 实时查看 <code>can1</code> 接口上的 CAN 信号：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">candump</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"修改-motorevo-关节模组-id泉智博\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#修改-motorevo-关节模组-id泉智博\">#</a> 修改 Motorevo 关节模组 ID（泉智博）</h2>\n<h3 id=\"参数与计算规则\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#参数与计算规则\">#</a> 参数与计算规则</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OLD_ID</code></td>\n<td>当前 Motor ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_ID</code></td>\n<td>目标 Motor ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OLD_CAN_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>0x600 + OLD_ID</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_CAN_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>0x600 + NEW_ID</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motor ID Index</td>\n<td><code>0x24</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read</td>\n<td><code>0x04</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td><code>0x15</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_ID_INT32_LE</code></td>\n<td>将新的 Motor ID 转换为 32 位小端整数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"操作前检查\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#操作前检查\">#</a> 操作前检查</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>确认当前使用的 CAN 接口名称。</li>\n<li>记录当前 Motor ID，并计算 <code>OLD_CAN_ID</code>。</li>\n<li>确定目标 Motor ID，并计算 <code>NEW_CAN_ID</code>。</li>\n<li>将目标 Motor ID 转换为 <code>NEW_ID_INT32_LE</code>。</li>\n<li>检查目标 ID 是否会与总线上的其他模组冲突。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"标准操作流程\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#标准操作流程\">#</a> 标准操作流程</h3>\n<h4 id=\"1-查询旧-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-查询旧-id\">#</a> 1. 查询旧 ID</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">OLD_CAN_I</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">D</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">#6724000000000476</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"2-修改-motor-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-修改-motor-id\">#</a> 2. 修改 Motor ID</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">OLD_CAN_I</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">D</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">#6724</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">NEW_ID_INT32_L</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">E</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">1576</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"3-查询新-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-查询新-id\">#</a> 3. 查询新 ID</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">NEW_CAN_I</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">D</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">#6724000000000476</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"4-保存到-flash\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#4-保存到-flash\">#</a> 4. 保存到 Flash</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">NEW_CAN_I</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">D</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">#6700000000000076</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sleep</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 2</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"5-再次确认\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#5-再次确认\">#</a> 5. 再次确认</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">NEW_CAN_I</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">D</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">#6724000000000476</span></span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"操作后检查\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#操作后检查\">#</a> 操作后检查</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>新 CAN ID 能够正常响应查询。</li>\n<li>旧 CAN ID 不再作为该模组的有效地址。</li>\n<li>保存到 Flash 后等待至少 2 秒，再执行确认查询。</li>\n<li>模组重新上电后，ID 仍保持为新值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"后续内容维护模板\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#后续内容维护模板\">#</a> 后续内容维护模板</h2>\n<p>新增命令时，建议复制下面的结构，以便长期保持文章清晰：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-markdown\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">##</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 功能名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">简要说明使用场景、适用设备和前置条件。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">###</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">\\`</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">``bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">#</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 在这里填写命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">\\`</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">``</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">###</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 参数说明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">参数名</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">：参数含义。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">###</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 检查事项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 执行前需要确认的事项。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 执行后用于判断成功的现象。</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"维护记录\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#维护记录\">#</a> 维护记录</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日期</th>\n<th>变更内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-08-11</td>\n<td>从《常用代码》整理 CAN 日志命令及 Motorevo Motor ID 修改流程。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
